# Valid quantity: kilogram measures mass — quantitykind:Mass and
# unit:KiloGM share dimension vector qkdv:A0E0L0I0M1H0T0D0 in QUDT
# v3.4.0, and neither is deprecated. Nothing new to flag.
@prefix qudt: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/> .
@prefix quantitykind: <http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/> .
@prefix unit: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/qudt-fixture#> .

ex:PayloadMass
  a qudt:Quantity ;
  qudt:hasQuantityKind quantitykind:Mass ;
  qudt:hasUnit unit:KiloGM ;
  qudt:quantityValue ex:PayloadMassValue .

ex:PayloadMassValue
  a qudt:QuantityValue ;
  qudt:numericValue "451.3"^^xsd:decimal ;
  qudt:unit unit:KiloGM .
